# Framer export → predeploy

This repo ships a single Framer `index.html`. A fresh paste reintroduces the Made in Framer badge and template SEO.

When `index.html` is replaced or edited from a Framer export:

1. Run `python3 scripts/predeploy.py`
2. Follow `PREDEPLOY.md`
3. Do not hand-edit badge HTML if the script can strip it
4. Put title, description, canonical, Open Graph, and FAQ copy in `site.meta.json`

Do not leave `#__framer-badge-container`, `__framer-badge`, Atmos metadata, or `*.framer.app` canonical URLs in the shipped file. Do not change Framer page layout to remove the badge.
